## Third-party interfaces that are not scapy's
`crates/wiry-pcap` declares libpcap's C interface. The declarations themselves
come from libpcap's own `pcap/pcap.h` and `pcap/bpf.h`:
    libpcap — https://github.com/the-tcpdump-group/libpcap
    Copyright (c) 1993-2023 The Regents of the University of California
    and the tcpdump.org contributors
    Licensed BSD-3-Clause
BSD-3-Clause is GPL-compatible, so those declarations may be used here. **No
libpcap code is copied or shipped**: wiry links against nothing and loads the
library the host already has, at run time.


