GPL-derived material existed in the tree while it was MIT — the relicence landed
first, deliberately, so that the provenance of every line is unambiguous from
the history alone.

The practical consequence, stated once so nobody has to work it out: a
downstream project that needs permissive terms can still fork `f756662`, but it
gets the tree as it stood then and none of the work after it.
